---
title: From customer feedback to validated product work
---
swimlane-beta TB
  subgraph customer [Originating user]
    feedback[/"`**Feedback**
    Where users already talk`"/]:::people
    interview["`**Interview Session**
    Observe · ask · agree
    Confirm flow classification`"]:::observation
    validate(["`**Validates the exact candidate**
    Tries it and confirms it's what they wanted`"]):::people
  end
  subgraph utrace [uTrace]
    router{Intake Router}:::gate
    noise(["`**Noise**
    No interview or Case File`"]):::neutral
    signal["`**Product Signal**
    Source-linked feedback
    Bugfix or feature request`"]:::runtime
    gate{{"`**Implementation Gate**
    Scope · policy · budgets`"}}:::gate
    attempt["`**Live Implementation Attempt**
    Adopts a speculative draft
    built before user approval
    Isolated workspace + fast checks`"]:::runtime
    later["`**Async Implementation Attempt**
    Built async after the call ends
    Reaches back out to validate`"]:::async
    preview["`**Preview Version**
    Immutable, swapped in whole`"]:::observation
    none["`**No implementation**
    Need and evidence recorded
    Excessive scope or lack of evidence`"]:::external
  end
  subgraph team [Client product team]
    casefile@{ shape: doc, label: "**Case File**<br/>Explains outcome and risk" }
    pr@{ shape: doc, label: "**Draft PR**<br/>Validated work only" }
  end
  feedback --> router
  router -->|creates| signal
  router -->|noise| noise
  signal -->|private invitation| interview
  interview -->|evidence| gate
  gate ==>|authorize live| attempt
  gate async_2@-.->|authorize async| later
  gate blocked_1@--->|no implementation| none
  attempt -->|fast checks passed · slow checks continue| preview
  later async_3@-.->|all checks passed| preview
  preview -->|handoff to the user| validate
  validate async_1@-.->|partially validated / not validated / unclear| gate
  validate -->|validated, or any outcome once iteration ends| casefile
  validate ok_1@-->|validated + all checks passed| pr
  none -->|no PR| casefile
  pr -->|links to| casefile
  class casefile,pr outcome
